{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":497479,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T22:11:06.230Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497479-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497479-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCloud Agent (GitHub, Slack, Web, Linear)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497479-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497479-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn Cursor iOS, the Agents Live Activity / lock-screen summary can show an agent as Waiting (e.g. summary “1 working · 1 waiting”) even though opening that agent shows it is actively working with nothing for the user to wait on.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExample agent (consistently mislabeled Waiting while always Working when opened):\u003c/p\u003e\u003caside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://authenticator.cursor.sh/?client_id=client_01GS6W3C96KW4WRS6Z93JCE2RJ\u0026amp;redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fcursor.com%2Fapi%2Fauth%2Fcallback\u0026amp;state=%257B%2522nonce%2522%253A%2522012fe50c-2912-46de-b81b-8291839721a6%2522%257D\u0026amp;authorization_session_id=01M330A5WMTJ852PEAW3H5N099\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"https://workos.imgix.net/app-branding/environment_01GS6W3C901N50J4ZGFB6V1Z6C/01K6ZWC3Q022AX8XY2B9TXGK9D\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://authenticator.cursor.sh/?client_id=client_01GS6W3C96KW4WRS6Z93JCE2RJ\u0026amp;redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fcursor.com%2Fapi%2Fauth%2Fcallback\u0026amp;state=%257B%2522nonce%2522%253A%2522012fe50c-2912-46de-b81b-8291839721a6%2522%257D\u0026amp;authorization_session_id=01M330A5WMTJ852PEAW3H5N099\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eauthenticator.cursor.sh\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://authenticator.cursor.sh/?client_id=client_01GS6W3C96KW4WRS6Z93JCE2RJ\u0026amp;redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fcursor.com%2Fapi%2Fauth%2Fcallback\u0026amp;state=%257B%2522nonce%2522%253A%2522012fe50c-2912-46de-b81b-8291839721a6%2522%257D\u0026amp;authorization_session_id=01M330A5WMTJ852PEAW3H5N099\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eSign in\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\nAgent name shown on lock screen: “OW: sync fleet cloud-agent templates”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHypothesis from reporter: status may flip to Waiting because follow-up messages were queued, even though the run itself is still executing and the agent UI shows Working with no pending user action.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497479-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497479-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn Cursor iOS 1.9.0 (39064), start or keep a Cloud/Background Agent running (example: \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-01a0c596-287c-7142-a625-019878d41f61\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://cursor.com/agents/bc-01a0c596-287c-7142-a625-019878d41f61\u003c/a\u003e).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOptionally queue one or more follow-up messages while it is running.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeave the app / look at the lock-screen Agents Live Activity (or the “N working · M waiting” summary).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve the agent listed as Waiting (duration keeps increasing).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTap into the same agent — it shows Working and there is nothing to wait on.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497479-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497479-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLive Activity / Agents summary status should match the agent’s real state. If the agent is executing work, it should show Working (or equivalent), not Waiting. Queued follow-ups should not mislabel an actively running agent as Waiting unless the product truly needs user input.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-497479-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-497479-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/f/df586e424865a63811a7162a735e3dd88e039e1e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/vRNW8W4WszyBouKbUc6GqrsdZ70.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"agent-waiting-ios-lockscreen.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/f/df586e424865a63811a7162a735e3dd88e039e1e_2_442x500.jpeg\" alt=\"agent-waiting-ios-lockscreen.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"vRNW8W4WszyBouKbUc6GqrsdZ70\" width=\"442\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/f/df586e424865a63811a7162a735e3dd88e039e1e_2_442x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/f/df586e424865a63811a7162a735e3dd88e039e1e_2_663x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/f/df586e424865a63811a7162a735e3dd88e039e1e_2_884x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"07090C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e